/-!
# Finite-dimensional Lindblad semigroup setup

This module provides the common import environment for finite-dimensional Lindblad semigroup
developments. It exposes the generator and evolution definitions from
`LindbladSemigroupCoreDefs`, together with channel, matrix-order, integration, and entropy tools
used by the subsequent proofs.

The imported `GKSL`, `lindbladApply`, and `lindbladSemigroup` implement the finite-dimensional
generator framework of [Lindblad1976] and [GoriniKossakowskiSudarshan1976].

## Main statements

* `GKSL`: a Hermitian Hamiltonian and a finite family of jump operators.
* `lindbladSemigroup`: the exponential-series evolution generated by `lindbladMap`.

## References

* [Lindblad, 1976][Lindblad1976]
* [Gorini et al., 1976][GoriniKossakowskiSudarshan1976]
-/

set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace Qatlib.Concepts.LindbladFlow.GkslSemigroup

open Matrix
open scoped MatrixOrder Matrix.Norms.L2Operator ComplexOrder ENNReal

end Qatlib.Concepts.LindbladFlow.GkslSemigroup
